hi I'm Jake Salomon the creative  director of X column and I'm here with a  way for you to experience X come from a  unique perspective traditionally XCOM  has used a zoomed out overhead tactical  camera so players can see the entire  battlefield players only get brief  glimpses of what the game looks like  from the ground level what you may not  know is that there's full camera control  that can be turned on at any time doing  so while you're nhq can let you take a  first-person tour of the Avenger now to  activate this mode you need only two  things XCOM 2 on Steam and a gaming  controller now first you'll need to  enable the game's dev commands detailed  directions on how to do this and more  can be found in the blog linked in the  description below if you already have  our modding tools installed then you're  ready to board the ship if not right  click on ExComm tune your Steam library  select properties then set launch  options underneath the general tab then  type in dash allow console all as one  word and then hit OK next launch the  game once you're in the Avenger hit the  tilde or backslash keys this opens up  the command line where you can enter any  of our dev commands with a debug camera  you'll want to type toggle debug camera  all is one word now you're ready to pick  up the controller and put yourself into  the Avenger see it exactly as your  soldiers do there are a ton of details  our team put into the Avenger that you  would never see with a regular camera  head to the living quarters and climb  into a soldier's bunk to learn a little  more about them stretch your legs by  heading to the roof of the Avenger to  soak in the scenery or leave the ship  entirely to take a hike see the sky  Ranger up close and head inside to take  a seat check out some relics from the  first war in the commander's quarters  have a staring contest with tiegan shen  central or any of your staff go take a  break from the aliens explore the  Avenger head to the barracks and spend  some quality time food troops good luck  commander  you
 

